'''R23-X9'''<ref name="Databank">{{Databank|r23-x9|R23-X9}}</ref> was an [[astromech droid]] owned by [[Torra Doza]] of [[Ace Squadron]].<ref name="The Recruit" /> Though it resembled an [[R-series]] astromech, it was a more specialized version custom-built for Doza,<ref name="SWE" /> and its color scheme was made to match Doza's state-of-the-art racer, the ''[[Blue Ace]]''.<ref name="Databank" />

